will be received therein with greetings and [words of] peace,","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":75,"sd":null},{"k":"25:76","t":"Abiding eternally therein. Good is the settlement and residence.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":76,"sd":null},{"k":"25:77","t":"Say, \"What would my Lord care for you if not for your supplication?\" For you [disbelievers] have denied, so it [i.e., your denial] is going to be adherent.","j":19,"h":37,"s":25,"a":77,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":37,"surahs":[25],"sajdah":false}